flowchart TD
    Start([Trainer / Owner Initiates Workout Creation]) --> OpenBuilder[Open Workout Routine Builder UI]
    
    OpenBuilder --> DefineMeta[Define Routine Metadata: Title, Goal, Duration Weeks]
    DefineMeta --> AddDays[Add Training Days e.g. Day 1: Chest & Triceps]
    
    AddDays --> SelectEx[Search & Add Exercises from Catalog]
    SelectEx --> CustomEx{Exercise Missing in Catalog?}
    CustomEx -->|Yes| CreateEx[Create Gym-Custom Exercise with Instructions]
    CreateEx --> SelectEx
    CustomEx -->|No| ConfigureSets[Configure Sets, Target Reps, RPE & Rest Seconds]
    
    ConfigureSets --> MoreEx{Add More Exercises to Day?}
    MoreEx -->|Yes| SelectEx
    MoreEx -->|No| MoreDays{Add More Days to Routine?}
    MoreDays -->|Yes| AddDays
    MoreDays -->|No| TargetChoice{Assignment Target?}
    
    TargetChoice -->|Reusable Template| SaveTemplate[Save as General Gym Template member_id = NULL]
    TargetChoice -->|Specific Client| SelectClient[Select Assigned Member from Client Roster]
    
    SelectClient --> AssignPlan[Save Plan with member_profile_id & gym_id]
    SaveTemplate --> PersistDB[(Save to MySQL via WorkoutService)]
    AssignPlan --> PersistDB
    
    PersistDB --> NotifyMember[Member Notified in App: New Plan Available]
    NotifyMember --> MemberOpens[Member Opens Routine in Fitness Portal]
    MemberOpens --> MemberLogs[Member Logs Completed Sets, Weights & Reps]
    MemberLogs --> PRCheck{Personal Record Broken?}
    PRCheck -->|Yes| FlagPR[Flag Set as is_pr = TRUE & Celebrate]
    PRCheck -->|No| SaveLog[Save Set Log to DB]
    FlagPR --> SaveLog
    SaveLog --> Complete([Workout Session Saved & Analytics Updated])
